<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 6 Results and Discussion ‣ Rethinking the Evaluation of Alignment Methods: Insights into Diversity, Generalisation, and Safety" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Conciseness</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 6 Results and Discussion ‣ Rethinking the Evaluation of Alignment Methods: Insights into Diversity, Generalisation, and Safety" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Ablation Study on Temperature</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Rethinking the Evaluation of Alignment Methods: Insights into Diversity, Generalisation, and Safety" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Conclusions</span></a></li>
