<figure id="S6.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>The results of the SFT, DPO, ORPO, PPO, KTO, and BON methods. The table shows the generalisation gap of each method across multiple dimensions, including diversity, factuality, conciseness, proactivity, and safety. We provide the results reflecting the performance gap for low and high generation temperature, <math id="S6.T4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.1</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S6.T4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1.0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.0</annotation></semantics></math> respectively.</figcaption>
