<span id="A3.F7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_align_right ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F7.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="490.61" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 152.76 490.61" width="152.76"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,490.61) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#6666FF;" fill="#6666FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.04 L 0 485.56 C 0 488.35 2.26 490.61 5.04 490.61 L 147.71 490.61 C 150.5 490.61 152.76 488.35 152.76 485.56 L 152.76 0 L 5.04 0 C 2.26 0 0 2.26 0 5.04 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#E6E6FF;" fill="#E6E6FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 5.04 L 1.11 485.56 C 1.11 487.74 2.87 489.5 5.04 489.5 L 147.71 489.5 C 149.89 489.5 151.65 487.74 151.65 485.56 L 151.65 1.11 L 5.04 1.11 C 2.87 1.11 1.11 2.87 1.11 5.04 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 468.08)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:8.03em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:32.89em;font-size:10pt;" height="464.77" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="111.11"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:8.03em;">
<span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[EVALUATION PROMPT]<span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Instruction:</span> </span>"Write a response that appropriately completes the request.
### Instruction: Estimate the number of hours it would take to paint a room.
### Input:
A 12x12 room with standard 8-foot ceilings.
### Response: "<span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Answer 2:</span> </span>Approximately 8 hours.<span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Answer 1:</span> </span>8-12 hours, depending on the level of detail and the skill of the painter.<span id="A3.F7.p1.pic1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span></span>
</span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
