<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 13: </span>The results of the SFT, DPO, ORPO, PPO, KTO, and BON methods. The table shows the detailed results of error rates(<math id="A4.T13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>) across dimensions defined for safety evaluation on datasets containing harmful content. We
provide the results reflecting the performance for low and high generation temperature, 0.1 and 1.0 respectively.</figcaption>
<table id="A4.T13.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
