<figure id="A4.T15" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 15: </span>The results of the SFT, DPO, ORPO, PPO, KTO, and BON methods. The table shows the detailed results of error rates(<math id="A4.T15.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>) across Factuality, Conciseness and FRR dimensions, and performance(<math id="A4.T15.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math>) on diversity dimensions such as NLI, EAD, Sent-BERT and Eigen-score. We provide the results on 1.0 generation temperature.</figcaption>
